            "Accesso ai repository: solo quelli qui sotto. Permessi: Actions — Read and write (senza annulla / rilancia basta Read-only), Contents — Read-only, Metadata — Read-only. Il token è conservato in Gestione credenziali di Windows, non in config.json.",
            "Acesso a repositórios: apenas os abaixo. Permissões: Actions — Read and write (sem cancelar / reexecutar basta Read-only), Contents — Read-only, Metadata — Read-only. O token fica no Gerenciador de Credenciais do Windows, não no config.json.",
            "Dostęp do repozytoriów: tylko te poniżej. Uprawnienia: Actions — Read and write (bez anulowania / ponownego uruchomienia wystarczy Read-only), Contents — Read-only, Metadata — Read-only. Token jest w Menedżerze poświadczeń Windows, nie w config.json.",
            "仓库访问：仅限下列仓库。权限：Actions — Read and write（不需要取消 / 重新运行时 Read-only 即可），Contents — Read-only，Metadata — Read-only。令牌保存在 Windows 凭据管理器中，而不是 config.json。",
